UID:1796083200000
URL:https://publictheater.org/performances-jp/2026/a/amber-iman/
DESCRIPTION:AMBER IMAN

Mon\, Nov 30th | 7:00 PM

GET TICKETS

Mon\, Nov 30th | 9:30 PM

GET TICKETS
AMBER IMAN (she/her) Broadway: Hadestown\, Lempicka (Tony and Drama League
  nominations)\; Soul Doctor (Clive Barnes Award nomination)\; Shuffle Alon
 g. Off-Broadway: Tartuffe\, Goddess (AUDELCO Award\, Drama Desk and Outer
 Critics Circle nominations)\, The Ford/Hill Project\, Rent. National Tours
 : Hamilton. Regional: Black Swan\, ART\; Goddess\, Berkeley Rep\; Hippest
 Trip\, ACT\; Radio Golf\, Two Rivers. Film & TV: Steve\; Blackberry Winter
 \; Forget Me Not\; “High Maintenance\,” HBO. Co-Founder: Broadway Advocacy
  Coalition (Tony Award)\; Black Women on Broadway. Education/Training: How
 ard University.

Website

Photo Credit: Matthew Murphy

Venue Joe's Pub

Runtime 75 minutes
LOCATION:Joe's Pub\, The Public Theater\, 425 Lafayette St\, New York\, NY
  10003
END:VEVENT
